    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 8.2</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="8.2"><pb n="250" ed="#liebermann"/>[Not in D]</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="8.2" corresp="#wit-k"><pb n="250" ed="#liebermann"/>⁊ þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> man frið ⁊ freondscipe rihtlice healde innan þysan earde for Gode ⁊ for worolde.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="8.2" corresp="#wit-k"><pb n="94" ed="#robertson"/>⁊ þæt man frið ⁊ freondscipe rihtlice healde innan þysan earde for Gode ⁊ for worolde.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k"><pb n="164" ed="#rabin-doml"/>And þæt man frið and freondscipe rihtlice healde innan þysan earde for Gode and for worolde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann"><pb n="250" ed="#liebermann"/>und dass man Frieden und Freundschaft rechtlich in diesem Lande in Geistlichem und Weltlichem halte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">and that peace and friendship be lawfully kept in this country in spiritual and secular matters.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k"><ptr type="editorNote" n="1" target="#VIAtr_8-2.robnote.n.1"/><pb n="95" ed="#robertson"/>and that peace and goodwill shall be duly maintained within this land in matters both religious and secular.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k"><pb n="165" ed="#rabin-doml"/>And that peace and friendship shall be properly preserved throughout this land before God and the world.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="250">V[?]</note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">Vgl. V[?]</note>
        <note type="comparisonIncomplete">Some of Liebermann’s notes here are cut off in the gutter of the scan used, and are still to be completed.</note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="endnote" xml:id="VIAtr_8-2.robnote.n.1" n="1" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">332</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="en">Cf. V, 1, 1.</seg></note>
      </div>
    </body>
